  <Place Angle="0" AngularSize="3.9423510000000004" Annotation="{&quot;channel&quot;: &quot;noirlab&quot;, &quot;itemid&quot;: &quot;noao-m81&quot;, &quot;publishedUTCISO8601&quot;: &quot;2020-06-30T21:33:51.923135+00:00&quot;}" Constellation="UMA" DataSetType="Sky" Dec="69.06804816209187" Magnitude="0" Name="M81, NGC 3031" Opacity="100" RA="9.929675229580546" Rotation="0" Thumbnail="http://data1.wwtassets.org/feeds/noirlab/noao-m81/thumb.jpg" ZoomLevel="3.9423510000000004">
    <Description>M81, a type Sb spiral galaxy in the constellation Ursa Major. This composite color image was created from CCD observations made at the Kitt Peak National Observatory&amp;#x27;s 0.9-meter telescope in late December 1994.</Description>
